rooms_desc ({"Labarum's house of love and Carnal pleasures. Here all who are invitedare asked to join in with there host in exotic fantasies. All invited guests are asked to explore there needs wants and desires here. So enjoy your stay and relax with your host.","This is a hallway that contains nothing much of interest except.......you glance up and see mistletoe hanging from one of the doorways.  Maybeyou should kiss someone who you are with.","This spacious room has a large fully stocked bar in one corner. Behind the bar there are two running taps: one of Molson Extra Dry, the otherimported Guiness Stout. Around the bar there are antique bar stools withcomfortable backings. Labarum and Sushi must use this room for theirparties. To the south is the enterance to Labarum's home, to the east is the kitchen.","	This private room overlooks a large empty valley.  It is late Springnow and the grass is a beautiful green.  It is about eight o'clock and the sun is setting over the trees on the other side of the valley. Youfeel at peace here as you look out the large windows and the sun shinesgently on your face.","This hallway connects the master and mistress's bedroom to the rest of the house.  It is well lit from the skylight in the ceiling. The room to the east is the master bedroom and back south lies the main part of this home.","This appears to be a bathroom. There is a shower with sliding doorson the left. There is a sink in front of you and the toilet is onthe right.","You have now entered the garden where Labarum relaxes and reads.As you look around the green grasses and well kept bushes, you realize that this is a very well kept garden.  The garden is inthe form of a small maze that can preserve the intimacy and solitude that he needs. Labarum would like you to look at hisshrubs and flowers. The exits here are south to the library andwest into the main part of the house.","Large oak bookshelves like the east and west walls of this lovelyroom. The bookshelves are filled with a variety of books ranging fromclassic literature to adventure to encyclopedia. The south of the roomthere are large windows that overlook the beach. Near the window,there is a chess set set up in the midst of a game.","This room has all the comforts of home. Large comfortable couchesline the walls. There is a table in the room which has somethingpainted on it. The television is on right now, so watch TV if youwish. The walls have photographs of people that you may know.","This is a beautiful room with large windows that allow the cool fresh nightair to relax those who sleep here.  A large canopy bed sits in the middle ofthe room with large antiquie oak pillars and a king sized matress.  The flooris covered by a thick and soft carpet.  In one corner there are two closets with doors.  The door leads back into the hall.",})
rooms_short ({"Labarum's house of love and karnal pleasures!!!!!","Enterance hall to a lovely home","Labarum's Bar Room.","A room overlooking a peaceful Valley","A hallway","Labarum's bathroom","Labarum's Garden","Labarum's library/game room","Labarum's living room","Saffron and Labarum's Bedroom",})
